LogIt is free on your phone, with no account needed. A free account also backs up your phone.
**Pro** adds sync between several phones and the web dashboard. **Studio** is for coaches and personal trainers. This table is made from the same list
the app uses, so it always matches what each plan really unlocks.

<PlanTable />

## Buying, changing and cancelling

Plans are bought in the Android app (Settings → Account), monthly or yearly, through Google Play.
Cancel in the Play Store under Payments and subscriptions; you keep your plan until the period you've
paid for ends. If you self-host the server, sync and the dashboard are free. See [Your account](/docs/account).

## Coached on the free plan

If a Studio coach coaches you, your workouts, food, bodyweight and check-ins sync so your coach can see
them, even on the free plan. See [Having a coach](/docs/having-a-coach).
